Package: byteport
Version: VERSION
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), systemd (>= 245)
Recommends: postgresql (>= 13)
Maintainer: BytePort Team <dev@byteport.dev>
Homepage: https://byteport.dev
Description: BytePort Cloud Gateway Daemon
 BytePort is a cloud gateway for ephemeral environments and deployment
 automation. This package provides the byteport daemon, systemd service
 unit, and CLI integration.
 .
 Features:
  - Ephemeral environment provisioning
  - Agent-to-agent (A2A) protocol support
  - MCP (Model Context Protocol) server
  - OpenTelemetry observability
  - Circuit-breaker resilience
